keywords:
  - Poincaré conjecture
  - Ricci flow
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
abstract: >-
  A complete Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the smooth and topological Poincaré
  theorems by Zhang, Delaval, Chen, Chen, Xu, Liao, Jiang, Liu and Dong (frenzymath,
  arXiv:2610.08329), copied unchanged, with an independent check added by Deep
  Bhattacharjee: a static scan, a statement audit, a CI build with the axioms and a
  kernel replay, and C, C++, Julia and Python checks.
